  "source_pdf": "downloads/wukong-visits-the-dentist-v3.pdf",
  "source_sha256": "9b66cbafdabe76191c88d207ec924371fee10c510d70cf85efd97b3583ab969c",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "f092e66829040d80a6f9cea7a9e6c6251289da431773da70c8a43f9cf5ff74d7",
      "text": "Wukong Visits\nthe Dentist",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "c51959f5362077f8643c2e30c3df85bb21a0deee191733674c25ad011e5fc0ea",
      "text": "Today Wukong\nvisits the dentist.\nSandy comes too.\n2",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "86728bb20f06913d3534db4f53f9764b897f608505acf0bde55abbf6191d309b",
      "text": "Pigsy is in the waiting room.\n“Hi, Wukong!”\nWukong sees a big chair.\n“Wow!”\n3",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "8732c337e452b98fe2ca4dd0dde5731f4f8dbadf937076e0b56b2c4e69ee6381",
      "text": "Bzzz, bzzz!\n“Is that a big bee?”\nWukong holds Sandy’s hand.\n4",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "586b34f67dfbb40623725a998f545e33f31a789ce6796392ef49b3e743d6c76e",
      "text": "The dentist smiles.\nLittle bears are on her shirt.\n“Hello, Wukong!\nLet’s look first.”\n5",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "11b55dcb4ab3b3afed6b51dc8e91b7bedec834d020bfbc2b25b0fe6646d9ed41",
      "text": "She shows a little mirror.\n“This helps me look\nat your teeth.”\n6",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "54584dba20fd678e45162a088a4fbefce2aafeb60985d3f200994e842645ab2b",
      "text": "“If you want to stop,\nraise your hand.\nThen I will stop.”\nWukong nods.\n7",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "f9aafdc72bd57ed403f967d12139a78c1841df92582365354870b6605f7a2fc8",
      "text": "Wukong climbs into the chair.\n“Ready?” asks the dentist.\nUp, up, up it goes!\n“Like a little cloud!”\n8",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d40267392cf8c4ef647db24ad30e1cbfcb391c9be703e4b1191d012fce546926",
      "text": "“Open wide,” says the dentist.\n“Ahhh!”\nShe looks at each tooth.\n9",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "67bfc88c843e258d98254de5f4db7d01eee50711eb6b75a5244ea296fb7cc498",
      "text": "Bzzz!\nWukong feels scared.\nHe raises his hand.\n10",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "3d78e73762dd5e7a7de0cd8015a1ee1c6626b54a5fc745662a455b32821b16d3",
      "text": "The dentist stops.\n“Okay. We can stop.”\nSandy holds his hand.\n11",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-12.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "2c0e06ebd7996f8f23f8d2513ff2eb98342ecfbc12f6b8a62bed9a36785b8932",
      "text": "Wukong asks,\n“What makes the bzzz?”\n“My little brush,” she says.\n“It tickles.”\n12",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-13.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d72b841fbd1dda971d0c271a7bdbefe2feaa5d0586e97fbc844165e287f56ff5",
      "text": "“Now I am ready,”\nsays Wukong.\nHe opens wide again.\n13",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-14.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "0d5d941f22e2cb0c76ffd594f113dd0ff81724bb85705bc2d732445ca247c78b",
      "text": "Bzzz, bzzz.\nTickle, tickle!\n“All done!” says the dentist.\n14",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-15.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "78714a694b175e449cc55cda1f62b3cefc32b8eda44e4e7356dfa219416acd4c",
      "text": "Wukong smiles in the mirror.\n“I told you what I needed!”\nAs he leaves, the dentist\ngives him a little toothbrush.\n15",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-16.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "88a935f77c58ee5f3a31b80986c232225067f81fffb3dd6e1c79b51fcd437fd2",
      "text": "At home, Pigsy’s toys line up.\n“Open wide!” says Wukong.\n“If you want to stop,\nraise your paw!”\n16",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-17.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d22637ab6fc3dba430ef0766620f48df979b60ce1dd6eb422e5d1b92cb88016b",
      "text": "Wukong & Friends\nThank you for reading!\nWe hope you and your little reader\nenjoyed this little adventure.\nMore free stories\nphg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends\nRead, download and print - always free.\nRead more free stories\nIf you enjoyed our stories, you are welcome\nto help the next one grow. Support is optional.\nBuy Me a Coffee\nGitHub Sponsors\nCreated by Peihong Guo\nStories and illustrations made with AI assistance and human editing.\n© 2026 Peihong Guo\nCC BY-NC-ND 4.0 · Attribution · NonCommercial · NoDerivatives\ncreativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/",
